      "innovation": "Knowledge-enhanced pre-training: fuses auto-regressive and auto-encoding networks to train on large-scale plaintexts and knowledge graphs simultaneously, addressing the lack of commonsense in plaintext-only models; Auxiliary adversarial loss: trains a credibility ranker to self-rank generated text and select the most credible output, improving text veracity and coherence compared to standard generation; Online distillation framework (On-the-Fly Distillation, teacher assistants, Auxiliary Layer Distillation): teaches multiple students simultaneously during pre-training, stacks an additional student layer during distillation (discarded at fine-tuning), and uses teacher assistants to bridge representation space gaps, enabling efficient distillation of the large model into multiple small models with little additional computation cost.",
